{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まず皆さん今日は、\nミーグリありがとうございました🤚🏻♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱい笑った！思い出増えた！(^ ^)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は夏の振り返りの続きです〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobSks8iI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うーーまい！！宮城のgood👍🏻✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年のツアーで、宮城の食べ物にどっぷりとハマってしまっていたので今年ご飯が楽しみでもあったのです！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "牛タンチケットを大事に取ってたら、他のご飯でお腹いっぱいになって結局あまり食べられなかったので、今年は最初から牛タン一直線！！！\n美味しかったよ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob9CVX5X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobuQEvRp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じゃん！！\n噂の揚げもみじ饅頭☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島県でのツアーが初めてだったので、嬉しかったし、美味しかったです(^^)笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobIzoce8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ケータリングの場所には、空と繋がっているオアシスがありました🍃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆうちゃんとこの下で、\nくっつきながら眺めて癒されてたなーーーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忘れない幸せな思い出↑↑☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob2XnbY1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここねん！！\n隣で夜ご飯食べた💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この夏で、ここねんの笑い声を今でも聞こえてくるくらいたくさん聞けたな〜〜！かわい(^з^)-♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いやぁいつか絶対にまた行きたいなーーー！\nライブがあったりすると、大好きになるの👀💫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんのライブの思い出だったり、おすすめの場所だったりもまたぜひ教えてください！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じゃあ次は、次の振り返りは福岡かな〜\n待っててください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も1日お疲れさまです🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}